    "text": "davisnewspaper.net\nwebsite\nDavis\nTexas Man Dies in Drowning\nBy Editor,\n1 days agoA Texas man lost his life at Turner Falls Park in a drowning. Officer Timothy Doolan was dispatched to Turner Falls Park in the evening hours of June 20. Officer Doolan said he spoke with the man’s sister that had gone under water. She told him that her brother, went down the slide, under the water and he never resurfaced.",
